        "Id": "1654d413-f0b0-4405-a8d1-e419689b30d0",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Stop The Construction!",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112855250485",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5976f2d9-4427-413f-a1ed-4c7b85e542fa).Image",
        "Description": "The construction sponsored by local Bartender turns out to not be so saint as people supposed...\r\rUnder the small village church they want to build secret lab, where they could potentially craft drugs or other poison.\r\rOur client paid us to stop the construction immediatelly.\rTo achieve that we will need to get rid of few workers, bus driver and guard, which should make other workers resign from job. Also kill the bartender himself. (Don&apos;t worry about workers, they knew it was illegal job)",
